 Publishers when a %s is submitted'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Onkọwe ti a yan nigba ti a ba fi %s ranṣẹ','Email designated Publishers when a %s is published'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Onkọwe ti a yan nigba ti a ba tẹ %s jade','Email designated Publishers when a %s is approved'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Onkọwe ti a yan nigba ti a ba gba %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is submitted'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Editeurs ati Awọn Alakoso nigba ti a ba fi %s ranṣẹ','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is published'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Editeurs ati Awọn Alakoso nigba ti a ba tẹ %s jade','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is approved'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn Editeurs ati Awọn Alakoso nigba ti a ba gba %s','PublishPress Revisions Site Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Oju opo wẹẹbu PublishPress Revisions','These are the default settings for options which can be adjusted per-site.'=>'Eyi ni awọn eto aiyipada fun awọn aṣayan ti a le ṣatunṣe fun aaye kọọkan.','Use this tab to make NETWORK-WIDE changes to PublishPress Revisions settings. %s'=>'Lo taabu yii lati ṣe awọn ayipada Nẹtiwọọki-GBỌDỌ si awọn eto PublishPress Revisions. %s','You can also specify %1$sdefaults for site-specific settings%2$s.'=>'O tun le tọka %1$s awọn aiyipada fun awọn eto aaye-pataki %2$s.','Here you can change the default value for settings which are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Nibi o le yi iye aiyipada pada fun awọn eto ti a n ṣakoso ni iṣakoso lọtọ lori aaye kọọkan.','Note that %1$s network-wide settings%2$s may also be available.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe %1$s awọn eto nẹtiwọọki-GBỌDỌ %2$s le tun wa.','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Past Revisions are earlier versions of a post.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe ti o ti kọja jẹ awọn ẹya iṣaaju ti ifiweranṣẹ kan.','This post type does not support Past Revisions.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin fun Awọn Atunṣe ti o ti kọja.','New Revisions are changes which are not yet published.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun jẹ awọn ayipada ti ko ti ṣee gbejade.','Note: Third party code may cause some post types to be incompatible with PublishPress Revisions.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi: Koodu ẹgbẹ kẹta le fa awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ kan lati ma ba PublishPress Revisions mu.','For Revisions integration on the Content Calendar, Overview and Content Board, please update %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.'=>'Fun iṣọpọ Revisions lori Kalẹnda Ọrọ, Akopọ ati Iboju Ọrọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.','Ready to enhance your revision workflow?'=>'Ṣe o ti setan lati mu ilọsiwaju iṣẹ atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro and optimize your revision process with custom revision statuses.'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro ki o si mu ilana atunṣe rẹ pọ si pẹlu awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Define your own statuses before or after Revision Submitted'=>'Ṣalaye awọn ipo tirẹ ki o to tabi lẹhin Atunṣe Ti Fi silẹ','New predefined statuses: Deferred, Needs Work, Rejected'=>'Awọn ipo ti a ti pinnu tuntun: Iṣakoso, Nilo Iṣẹ, Kọ','Statuses can be specific to a post type'=>'Awọn ipo le jẹ pato si iru ifiweranṣẹ kan','Control access to statuses per-role'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si awọn ipo ni ibamu si ipa','Status workflow can be nested with sub-statuses'=>'Ilana ipo le jẹ adalu pẹlu awọn ipo-kekere','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro','Learn More'=>'Kọ ẹkọ diẹ sii','Pro Plugin'=>'Pro Plugin','Install Statuses Pro to unlock custom revision statuses.'=>'Fi Statuses Pro sori ẹrọ lati ṣii awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Configure for any post type and role to match your editing workflow.'=>'Ṣeto fun eyikeyi iru ifiweranṣẹ ati ipa lati ba iṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ rẹ mu.','Get Statuses Pro'=>'Gba Statuses Pro','Maximum revisions per post:'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn atunṣe fun ifiweranṣẹ:','(unlimited)'=>'(ailewu)','Note that archiving can also be disabled by %1$sPost Type%2$s.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe a le tun pa ifiṣura silẹ nipasẹ %1$sIru Ifiweranṣẹ%2$s.','%s capability'=>'%s agbara','Assign capability to roles'=>'Pẹlu agbara si awọn ipa','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the %s.'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati mu atunṣe pada laisi %s.','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the restore_revisions capability'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati mu atunṣe pada laisi agbara restore_revisions','Modification Date'=>'Ọjọ Iṣakoso','Revision Creation'=>'Ṣiṣẹda Atunṣe','Submission'=>'Fifiranṣẹ','Scheduling'=>'Iṣeto','Publication'=>'Itẹjade','Management'=>'Iṣakoso','Create Revision capabilities'=>'Ṣẹda awọn agbara Atunṣe','Assign capabilities to roles'=>'Pẹlu awọn agbara si awọn ipa','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Create Revision capabilities (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Ṣẹda Atunṣe (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','To expand the Pages list, assign %s.'=>'Lati fa akojọ Awọn Oju-iwe, yan %s.','Listing capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara atokọ','To expand the Pages list, assign Listing capabilities (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, etc.)'=>'Lati fa akojọ Awọn Oju-iwe, yan Awọn agbara Atokọ (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','This plugin introduces a new user role, "Revisor."'=>'Plugin yii n ṣafihan ipa olumulo tuntun, "Revisor."','Revision by a user who does not have the %s will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni %s yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn afi html aṣa yọ kuro.','Revision by a user who does not have the unfiltered_html capability will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni agbara unfiltered_html yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn afi html aṣa yọ kuro.','Broadest compat including Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder'=>'Ibi diẹ ti o gbooro pẹlu Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder','Standard storage schema for broadest 3rd party compat'=>'Iṣeto ibi ipamọ boṣewa fun ibamu 3rd party ti o gbooro julọ','Enhanced Revision access control with PublishPress plugins'=>'Iṣakoso wiwọle Atunṣe ti a mu pọ pẹlu awọn plugin PublishPress','In enhanced mode, a Revision\'s status is stored by standard WordPress schema. Some plugins are incompatible.'=>'Ninu ipo ti a mu pọ, ipo Atunṣe kan ni a tọju nipasẹ iṣeto boṣewa WordPress. Awọn plugin kan ko ni ibamu.','Prevent Revision creation if the post already has another Revision in progress.'=>'Ṣe idiwọ ẹda Atunṣe ti ifiweranṣẹ naa ba ti ni Atunṣe miiran ti n lọ.','Work around cache plugin conflicts by requerying for revisions before suppressing the New Revision link.'=>'Bọsipọ awọn ariyanjiyan plugin cache nipa ṣiṣe ibeere fun awọn atunṣe ṣaaju ki o to pa ọna asopọ Atunṣe Tuntun.','If the user does not have a regular Edit link, recaption the %s link as "Edit."'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba ni ọna asopọ Edit boṣewa, tun ṣe akọle %s ọna asopọ bi "Ṣatunkọ."','Default labels are "Not Submitted for Approval", "Submitted for Approval", "Scheduled Revision"'=>'Awọn afi aiyipada ni "Ko ti fi silẹ fun Igbasilẹ", "Ti fi silẹ fun Igbasilẹ", "Atunṣe ti a Ṣeto"','Enable published content to be copied, edited, submitted for approval and managed on the %sNew Revisions%s screen.'=>'Mu ki akoonu ti a tẹjade le jẹ ẹda, ṣe atunṣe, fi silẹ fun igbasilẹ ati ṣakoso lori iboju %sAtunṣe Tuntun%s.','Submit Revision capabilities'=>'Fi awọn agbara Atunṣe silẹ','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Submit Revision capabilities (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Fi Atunṣe silẹ (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','When a %s is published, update post publish date to current time.'=>'Nigbati a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ atẹjade ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a %s is published, update post modified date to current time.'=>'Nigbati a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ti a ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a new revision is created by any user who is allowed to submit revisions, automatically submit it.'=>'Nigbati a ba ṣẹda atunṣe tuntun nipasẹ olumulo eyikeyi ti a gba laaye lati fi awọn atunṣe silẹ, fi silẹ laifọwọyi.','Auto-submit revisions if the user can directly edit the main post.'=>'Fi awọn atunṣe silẹ laifọwọyi ti olumulo ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ taara.','This allows immediate approval within the Compare screen. If disabled, a Preview link is provided instead.'=>'Eyi n jẹ ki iṣeduro lẹsẹkẹsẹ wa ninu iboju Awọn Afijẹẹri. Ti a ko ba mu ṣiṣẹ, a pese ọna asopọ Ifihan dipo.','If a currently published post or page is edited and a future date set, the change will not be applied until the selected date.'=>'Ti a ba ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ tabi oju-iwe ti a tẹjade lọwọlọwọ ati pe a ti ṣeto ọjọ iwaju, ayipada naa kii yoo lo titi di ọjọ ti a yan.','Publish scheduled revisions using the WP-Cron mechanism. On some sites, publication will fail if this setting is disabled.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ti ṣeto nipa lilo ọna WP-Cron. Ni diẹ ninu awọn aaye, atẹjade yoo kuna ti a ko ba mu eto yii ṣiṣẹ.','Publish scheduled revisions asynchronously, via a secondary http request from the server.  This is usually best since it eliminates delay, but some servers may not support it.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ti ṣeto ni aimi, nipasẹ ibeere http keji lati ọdọ olupin. Eyi jẹ julọ dara nitori pe o yọkuro idaduro, ṣugbọn diẹ ninu awọn olupin le ma ṣe atilẹyin rẹ.','The WP-Cron trigger is disabled, but scheduled tasks are still excecuted using a custom trigger.'=>'Ibi ifilọlẹ WP-Cron ti wa ni aifọwọyi, ṣugbọn awọn iṣẹ ti a ti ṣeto ṣi wa ni ṣiṣe nipa lilo ifilọlẹ aṣa kan.','Caption the button as either "Approve and Publish" or "Approve and Schedule."'=>'Fọwọsi bọtini naa bi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣe atẹjade" tabi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣeto."','This may improve compatibility with some plugins.'=>'Eyi le mu ibamu pọ si pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn afikun.','Control New Revisions access with the %s.'=>'Ṣakoso iwọle si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu %s.','Control New Revisions access with the manage_revision_queue capability.'=>'Ṣakoso iwọle si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu agbara manage_revision_queue.','Users will need the %s to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo %s lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','Users will need the manage_unsubmitted_revisions capability to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo agbara manage_unsubmitted_revisions lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the edit_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_revisions.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the list_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara list_others_revisions.','Bypass the above restrictions for others\' revisions to logged in user\'s own posts.'=>'Gba awọn ihamọ loke silẹ fun awọn atunṣe ti awọn miiran si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo ti o wọle.','Regenerate "post has revision" flags'=>'Tun ṣe agbekalẹ "ifihanṣẹ ti ni atunṣe" awọn asia','Apply this maintenance operation if Has Revision labels on Posts / Pages screens mismatch the New Revisions listing.'=>'Lọ́wọ́ iṣẹ́ ìtọ́jú yìí bí Has Revision awọn aami lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ / oju-iwe ko ba baamu pẹlu atokọ Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun.','For enhanced notifications, install %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti o ni ilọsiwaju, fi sori ẹrọ %sPublishPress Planner%s.','For enhanced notifications, update %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti a ti mu pọ si, ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner%s.','Send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Firanṣẹ awọn iwifunni igbese atunṣe nipa lilo %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s ti a le ṣe adani.','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Gba Revisions Pro lati firanṣẹ awọn iwifunni igbese atunṣe nipa lilo %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s ti a le ṣe adani.','Users matching Planner > Notifications configuration get revision notifications only if they can edit the published post.'=>'Awọn olumulo ti o baamu pẹlu Planner > Awọn iṣeto iwifunni yoo gba awọn iwifunni atunṣe nikan ti wọn ba le ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade.','Never'=>'Ko si','By default'=>'Nipasẹ aiyipada','Always'=>'Nigbagbogbo','select recipients'=>'yan awọn olugba','To avoid notification failures, buffer emails for delayed sending once minute, hour or day limits are exceeded'=>'Lati yago fun awọn ikuna iwifunni, pa awọn imeeli fun ikojọpọ pẹ nigbati awọn aala iṣẹju, wakati tabi ọjọ ba wọle','Notification Buffer'=>'Ikojọpọ Iwifunni','Notification Log'=>'Iwe itẹlọrun Iwifunni','Purge Notification Buffer'=>'Pa Ikojọpọ Iwifunni','Truncate Notification Log'=>'Ge Iwe itẹlọrun Iwifunni','Sent in last minute: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni iṣẹju to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last hour: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni wakati to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last day: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni ọjọ to kẹhin: %d / %d','Seconds until next buffer processing time: %d'=>'Awọn aaya titi di akoko iṣakoso ikojọpọ ti n bọ: %d','Show Notification Log / Buffer'=>'Fihan Iwe itẹlọrun Iwifunni / Ikojọpọ','Show with message content'=>'Fihan pẹlu akoonu ifiranṣẹ','Ready to enhance your revision notifications?'=>'Ṣetan lati mu awọn iwifunni atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Upgrade to Revisions Pro for integration with our PublishPress Planner Notifications framework.'=>'Ṣe igbesoke si Revisions Pro fun isopọ pẹlu ilana awọn iwifunni PublishPress Planner wa.','Customize notification message and subject'=>'Ṣe aṣa ifiranṣẹ iwifunni ati akọle','Notify for a specific post type, category or term'=>'Kọ iwifunni fun iru ifiweranṣẹ pataki, ẹka tabi ọrọ','Target specific roles, users, or user groups'=>'Mọ awọn ipa pataki, awọn olumulo, tabi awọn ẹgbẹ olumulo','With PublishPress Planner Pro, send notifications to a Slack channel'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Planner Pro, fi awọn iwifunni ranṣẹ si ikanni Slack','Pro Feature'=>'Ẹya Pro','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to unlock Planner Notifications integration.'=>'Ṣe igbesoke si Revisions Pro lati ṣii isopọ iwifunni Planner.','Customize notification content and recipients for each notification type.'=>'Ṣe aṣa akoonu iwifunni ati awọn olugba fun ọkọọkan awọn iru iwifunni.','Some themes may block revision preview.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le dènà iworan atunṣe.','Published Post Slug'=>'Slug Ifiweranṣẹ Ti a tẹjade','Revision Slug'=>'Slug Atunṣe','Revision ID only'=>'ID Atunṣe nikan','Some themes or plugins may require Revision Slug or Revision ID link type for proper template loading and field display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori tabi awọn afikun le nilo Slug Atunṣe tabi ID Atunṣe iru ọna asopọ fun ikojọpọ awoṣe to pe ati ifihan aaye.','The revision preview argument is configured by constant definition: %s'=>'Arugba iworan atunṣe ti ṣeto nipasẹ itumọ alailẹgbẹ: %s','Adjust preview links to use "rv_preview" argument instead of "preview". Experiment to see which works best with your theme.'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn ọna asopọ iworan lati lo "rv_preview" arugba dipo "iworan". Ṣe idanwo lati rii eyi ti o ṣiṣẹ dara julọ pẹlu akori rẹ.','Some themes may require this setting for correct revision preview display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le nilo eto yii fun ifihan iworan atunṣe to pe.','This should usually be enabled, except to work around conflicts with other another plugin\'s postmeta data.'=>'Eyi yẹ ki o ma jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ, ayafi lati yago fun awọn ija pẹlu data postmeta ti afikun miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the %s to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere %s lati ṣatunkọ awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ti tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the edit_others_drafts capability to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_drafts lati ṣatunkọ awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ti tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If post-specific permissions restrict or expand access to a post, apply those permissions to its revisions also.'=>'Ti awọn aṣẹ pataki ti ifiweranṣẹ ba dènà tabi fa iraye si ifiweranṣẹ, lo awọn aṣẹ wọnyẹn si awọn atunṣe rẹ paapaa.','Rank Math SEO may prevent Revision update on some sites.'=>'Rank Math SEO le ṣe idiwọ imudojuiwọn Atunṣe lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye.','WPML Translation Management'=>'Iṣakoso Itumọ WPML','Sync "Needs Update" flags'=>'Sopọ "Nilo imudojuiwọn" awọn asia','Set "Needs Update" for any post with translations which was updated (possibly by revision approval) more recently than its translations.'=>'Ṣeto "Nilo imudojuiwọn" fun eyikeyi ifiweranṣẹ pẹlu awọn itumọ ti a ṣe imudojuiwọn (o ṣee ṣe nipasẹ ifọwọsi atunṣe) laipẹ ju awọn itumọ rẹ lọ.','Show descriptive captions for PublishPress Revisions settings.'=>'Fi awọn akọsilẹ apejuwe han fun awọn eto Atunṣe PublishPress.','Plugin settings, New Revisions contents and related data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Revisions / Revisions Pro is deleted.'=>'Awọn eto afikun, Awọn akoonu Atunṣe Tuntun ati awọn data ti o ni ibatan yoo parẹ, ṣugbọn nikan lẹhin ti ẹda ikẹhin ti Atunṣe / Atunṣe Pro ti parẹ.','Unlock Pro Integrations'=>'Ṣiṣi Awọn iṣọpọ Pro','Upgrade to the Pro version for optimal compatibility and prompt, professional support.'=>'Gba ẹya Pro fun ibamu to dara julọ ati atilẹyin ọjọgbọn, ni kiakia.','Admin'=>'Alakoso','Builder'=>'Olùkànsí','Cache'=>'Cache','E-Commerce'=>'E-Commerce','Fields'=>'Awọn aaye','Multilingual'=>'Ọpọ ede','SEO'=>'SEO','Workflow'=>'Ilana iṣẹ','Specify which PublishPress Revisions Settings to control network-wide. Unselected settings are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Ṣalaye awọn Eto Atunṣe Pu